  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "releaseNotes": "First preview of the clean-room .NET client for Apache RocketMQ 5.x.\n- Producer: send / batch send / transactions / recall / lite messages\n- SimpleConsumer: receive / ack / change invisible duration\n- PushConsumer: runtime subscriptions / queue assignment / ack and nack retry / FIFO local redelivery with an advancing delivery attempt\n- LitePushConsumer and LiteSimpleConsumer: lite topics / offset options / quota tracking\n- gRPC v2 protocol over the 5.x proxy with a reconnecting telemetry stream\nOut of scope for now: metrics and OpenTelemetry.",
